    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444000/extras/3c3627926b82316996b1e6be2a184884.avif?t=1726255642\" /></div><br><br><strong>Super Night Riders</strong> is a modern arcade racing game inspired by the retro classics.<br><br>You are <i>Alice</i>, a beautiful and talented motorcyclist known as the <i>Red Rider</i>.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444000/extras/ccbd5511f2fe574ef951100555a3d909.poster.avif?t=1726255642\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444000/extras/ccbd5511f2fe574ef951100555a3d909.webm?t=1726255642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444000/extras/ccbd5511f2fe574ef951100555a3d909.mp4?t=1726255642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>In this game, your position in the race does not matter. It's all about traveling as far as possible while dodging the rival riders, and reaching each checkpoint before the timer hits zero.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444000/extras/dd7c7519896303e521da09288064aed1.poster.avif?t=1726255642\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444000/extras/dd7c7519896303e521da09288064aed1.webm?t=1726255642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444000/extras/dd7c7519896303e521da09288064aed1.mp4?t=1726255642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>All the races starts during the day and continue through the night right up until sunrise.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444000/extras/1b560e8f0475e332fbd39045c4484ca8.avif?t=1726255642\" /></div><br><br>The game features 2 visual styles: <i>Super</i> and <i>Classic</i>.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444000/extras/ae205c96bb90706ba3ad943af01716b2.avif?t=1726255642\" /></div><br><br>Ride through 36 beautiful stages in 6 challenging courses!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444000/extras/a241ef0f913da043776f3ff31375f092.avif?t=1726255642\" /></div><br><br><strong>About neko.works</strong><br><i>neko.works</i> is a one person indie game studio from France, making modern renditions of classic concepts.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444000/extras/3c3627926b82316996b1e6be2a184884.avif?t=1726255642\" /></div><br><br><strong>Super Night Riders</strong> is a modern arcade racing game inspired by the retro classics.<br><br>You are <i>Alice</i>, a beautiful and talented motorcyclist known as the <i>Red Rider</i>.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444000/extras/ccbd5511f2fe574ef951100555a3d909.poster.avif?t=1726255642\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444000/extras/ccbd5511f2fe574ef951100555a3d909.webm?t=1726255642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444000/extras/ccbd5511f2fe574ef951100555a3d909.mp4?t=1726255642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>In this game, your position in the race does not matter. It's all about traveling as far as possible while dodging the rival riders, and reaching each checkpoint before the timer hits zero.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444000/extras/dd7c7519896303e521da09288064aed1.poster.avif?t=1726255642\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444000/extras/dd7c7519896303e521da09288064aed1.webm?t=1726255642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444000/extras/dd7c7519896303e521da09288064aed1.mp4?t=1726255642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>All the races starts during the day and continue through the night right up until sunrise.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444000/extras/1b560e8f0475e332fbd39045c4484ca8.avif?t=1726255642\" /></div><br><br>The game features 2 visual styles: <i>Super</i> and <i>Classic</i>.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444000/extras/ae205c96bb90706ba3ad943af01716b2.avif?t=1726255642\" /></div><br><br>Ride through 36 beautiful stages in 6 challenging courses!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444000/extras/a241ef0f913da043776f3ff31375f092.avif?t=1726255642\" /></div><br><br><strong>About neko.works</strong><br><i>neko.works</i> is a one person indie game studio from France, making modern renditions of classic concepts.",
